--- !u!114 &1938851462
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1938851460}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3b400c73cae759141952f2d3a4056940, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StepAudioPlayer
  audioSource: {fileID: 1938851463}
  subtitleText: {fileID: 35578231}
  continueButton: {fileID: 113863560}
  subtitles:
  - text: "\u015Eimdi Ay tutulmas\u0131n\u0131 inceleyelim."
    startTime: 0
    endTime: 2
  - text: "G\xFCne\u015F tutulmas\u0131nda Ay, G\xFCne\u015F ile D\xFCnya aras\u0131na
      giriyordu. "
    startTime: 2
    endTime: 6
  - text: "Ay tutulmas\u0131nda ise bu kez D\xFCnya, G\xFCne\u015F ile Ay\u2019\u0131n
      aras\u0131na girer."
    startTime: 6
    endTime: 10
  - text: "Normal durumda Ay, G\xFCne\u015F\u2019ten ald\u0131\u011F\u0131 \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131
      yans\u0131tarak parlak g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr. "
    startTime: 10
    endTime: 17
  - text: "Ancak D\xFCnya, G\xFCne\u015F \u0131\u015F\u0131nlar\u0131n\u0131n Ay\u2019a
      ula\u015Fmas\u0131n\u0131 engelledi\u011Finde "
    startTime: 17
    endTime: 21
  - text: "Ay, D\xFCnya\u2019n\u0131n g\xF6lge alan\u0131na girmeye ba\u015Flar."
    startTime: 21
    endTime: 24
  - text: "Ay \xF6nce D\xFCnya\u2019n\u0131n yar\u0131 g\xF6lge b\xF6lgesine girer.
      Bu a\u015Famada Ay\u2019\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011F\u0131 hafif\xE7e azal\u0131r. "
    startTime: 24
    endTime: 30
  - text: "Ay tamamen D\xFCnya\u2019n\u0131n tam g\xF6lgesine girdi\u011Finde \"Tam
      Ay Tutulmas\u0131\" ger\xE7ekle\u015Fir. "
    startTime: 30
    endTime: 35
  - text: "Bu s\u0131rada Ay tamamen kaybolmaz; atmosferden k\u0131r\u0131larak gelen
      \u0131\u015F\u0131k nedeniyle "
    startTime: 35
    endTime: 40
  - text: "koyu k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131ya ya da bak\u0131r rengine yak\u0131n bir
      g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm alabilir."
    startTime: 40
    endTime: 44
  - text: "K\u0131saca Ay tutulmas\u0131, D\xFCnya\u2019n\u0131n G\xFCne\u015F ile
      Ay aras\u0131na girmesi"
    startTime: 44
    endTime: 48
  - text: "ve D\xFCnya\u2019n\u0131n g\xF6lgesinin Ay\u2019\u0131n \xFCzerine d\xFC\u015Fmesiyle
      olu\u015Fur."
    startTime: 48
    endTime: 51
