--- !u!114 &2005472961
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2005472959}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3b400c73cae759141952f2d3a4056940, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StepAudioPlayer
  audioSource: {fileID: 2005472960}
  subtitleText: {fileID: 1404117850}
  continueButton: {fileID: 1967564274}
  subtitles:
  - text: "\u015Eimdi olaya daha geni\u015F a\xE7\u0131dan bakal\u0131m."
    startTime: 0
    endTime: 2
  - text: "Bu g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCmde G\xFCne\u015F, Ay ve D\xFCnya\u2019n\u0131n konumlar\u0131n\u0131
      birlikte inceliyoruz."
    startTime: 2
    endTime: 6
  - text: "G\xFCne\u015F\u2019ten gelen \u0131\u015F\u0131nlar Ay\u2019a ula\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131nda,
      Ay\u2019\u0131n arkas\u0131nda bir g\xF6lge alan\u0131 olu\u015Fur. "
    startTime: 6
    endTime: 12
  - text: "Bu g\xF6lge D\xFCnya\u2019n\u0131n \xFCzerine d\xFC\u015Ft\xFC\u011F\xFCnde
      G\xFCne\u015F tutulmas\u0131 ger\xE7ekle\u015Fir."
    startTime: 12
    endTime: 17
  - text: "G\xF6lgenin en koyu ve dar olan k\u0131sm\u0131na tam g\xF6lge denir."
    startTime: 17
    endTime: 21
  - text: "D\xFCnya \xFCzerinde bu b\xF6lgeye denk gelen yerlerde tam tutulma g\xF6r\xFCl\xFCr. "
    startTime: 21
    endTime: 25
  - text: "Daha geni\u015F ve daha a\xE7\u0131k olan b\xF6lge ise yar\u0131 g\xF6lgedir. "
    startTime: 25
    endTime: 29
  - text: "Bu b\xF6lgede bulunan ki\u015Filer G\xFCne\u015F\u2019i tamamen de\u011Fil,
      k\u0131smen kapanm\u0131\u015F \u015Fekilde g\xF6r\xFCr. "
    startTime: 29
    endTime: 35
  - text: "Bu y\xFCzden burada par\xE7al\u0131 tutulma ya\u015Fan\u0131r."
    startTime: 35
    endTime: 37
  - text: "Sonu\xE7 olarak G\xFCne\u015F tutulmas\u0131, Ay\u2019\u0131n G\xFCne\u015F
      ile D\xFCnya aras\u0131na girmesi "
    startTime: 37
    endTime: 41
  - text: "ve Ay\u2019\u0131n g\xF6lgesinin D\xFCnya \xFCzerine d\xFC\u015Fmesiyle
      olu\u015Fur."
    startTime: 41
    endTime: 45
